        <updated>2026-09-28T21:01:59-04:00</updated>
            <summary type="html">
                <![CDATA[
                        <img src="https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/media/posts/23/freshly-baked-bread-stockcake.jpg" alt="" />
                    I smell the bread baking and I’m reminded of your soft hands&hellip;
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/media/posts/23/freshly-baked-bread-stockcake.jpg" class="type:primaryImage" alt="" /></p>
                <div class="align-center">I smell the bread baking<br>and I’m reminded of your soft hands<br>touching that fleshy dough.<br>You make me hungry.</div>
<div class="align-center"> </div>
<div class="align-center">As steam and hot scent<br>escape from the oven door,<br>I see our reflection in the glass.<br>My face is covered in sweat.</div>
<div class="align-center"> </div>
<div class="align-center">Though you give me a generous slice,<br>hot with salted butter;<br>even while the taste still lingers,<br>I want more.</div>
            ]]>
        </content>
